      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FEISTY TIGER (2) turned in another good effort last start when she led and battled on well but found one better at Dubbo over 1720m. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Good enough to put herself back in the winners' stall. LOLLIPOP (9) took charge early on and kept going to record a commanding 6 metres win last start over 2120m at Dubbo, following on from a strong third the run prior at Young. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. Won't find this any harder and she can salute once again. LADY DELORIS (7) has to come into calculations on the back of some strong recent form, most recently when fifth at Dubbo over 2120m. Must be included in exotic bets. SWEET SWEET TOOTH (5) was out of the money two runs ago then broke after suffering interference and finished sixth last start over 1720m at Young, arriving 11 metres behind the winner. Won't find this any harder and she can bounce back.",
